ns%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1535,"digest":"sha256:5e065ce7cf7d838f0038438d26f4fb168af4ca5a64fba130f66302e041891038","download_count":1708,"created_at":"2026-10-06T12:09:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T12:09:32Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/releases/download/v0.2.1/SHA256SUMS.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storytold/lightcraft/tarball/v0.2.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storytold/lightcraft/zipball/v0.2.1","body":"## What's Changed\n* Persistence: a failed save fails the command (change kept in memory, queued, retried) by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/82\n* Local: forget untouched browse records of folders not browsed for 30 days by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/83\n* Issue #78: GPU export: respect device limits, fall back to CPU on GPU errors by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/84\n* Issue #10: Raw: Nikon compressed NEF (lossless + lossy) by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/86\n* Docs: honest parity assessment — where we stand, where we're going by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/87\n* Issue #85: Raw: CR2 colour pattern from the file's CR2CFAPattern tag, not a constant by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/88\n* Ignore /target-*/ build dirs by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/89\n* docs: point agents to the shared test corpora by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/90\n* FreeBSD: build and test the workspace in a FreeBSD VM by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/91\n* FreeBSD CI: match the shared template by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/108\n* Metadata: gracefully ignore invalid Unicode timezone offsets by @storybored379 in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/111\n* Add Japanese menus and vertical Japanese text watermarks by @midasdf in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/110\n* Issue #93: Export: never overwrite an original; atomic writes by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/116\n* Issue #106: Convert to DNG and smart previews: verified, atomic writes by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/117\n* Issue #96: Import > Copy verifies each copy like Move by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/118\n* Issue #98: thumbnail cache only lists, counts and deletes its own files by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/119\n* Issue #95: Rename Photos: case-only renames never overwrite another file by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/120\n* Issue #105: Rename Photos reports failed rollbacks; Find Missing matches by content by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/121\n* Issue #92: Rename Photos copies a stem sidecar another file still shares by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/122\n* Issue #92: XMP: merge into an existing sidecar instead of replacing it by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/123\n* Issue #101: catalog.log: cut a partial append back before retrying by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/124\n* Issue #102: Catalog format version 2; refuse newer libraries untouched by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/125\n* Issue #99: Library: exclusive lock so two processes can't open one library by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/126\n* Issue #100: Ask what to do when the library can't be opened, never a silent demo session by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/127\n* Issue #103: Settings files: keep damaged ones, never overwrite unread ones, write ui.json atomically, confirm quit with unsaved changes by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/128\n* Issue #94: Control: close the connection on malformed input by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/129\n* Issue #97: Rename Folder / Move Folder are undo steps by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/130\n* Issue #107: Web build: data-safety fixes for libraries kept in the browser by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/131\n* Issue #104: keep file-system calls off the UI thread by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/132\n* Extend Japanese localization across editing, import and export UI by @arata-1972 in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/114\n* Improve Sony ARW starting colour and tone, and preserve decoded source metadata by @arata-1972 in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/115\n* Windows packaging: Start Menu/Add-Remove icon, no console window, correct description by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/139\n* Release: LightCraft v0.2.1 by @echelon in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/140\n\n## New Contributors\n* @midasdf made their first contribution in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/110\n* @arata-1972 made their first contribution in https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/pull/114\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/compare/v0.2.0...v0.2.1","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storytold/lightcraft/releases/404664767/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":4}